  "stem": "In the \\(xy\\)-plane, the graph of \\(ax + by = 30\\), where \\(a\\) and \\(b\\) are constants, passes through the points \\((5, 0)\\) and \\((2, 4)\\). What is the value of \\(b\\)?",
  "figure": null,
  "answer_type": "spr",
  "choices": null,
  "answer": null,
  "spr_answers": [
    "9/2"
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Substitute \\((5, 0)\\): \\(5a = 30\\), so \\(a = 6\\).",
    "Substitute \\((2, 4)\\): \\(6(2) + 4b = 30\\), so \\(4b = 18\\) and \\(b = \\frac{9}{2}\\)."
  ],
  "verify": "a, b = symbols('a b')\nsol = solve([Eq(5*a, 30), Eq(2*a + 4*b, 30)], [a, b])\nassert sol[b] == Rational(9, 2)\nassert [Rational(s) for s in spr_answers] == [sol[b]]",
